{"results": [{"name": "Schmidt's Naturals", "entity_id": "33697949-06C0-4010-90CA-2A1A8431ED24", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [], "description": "Schmidt's Naturals is a pioneering personal care brand dedicated to creating effective, plant-based deodorants that challenge the status quo. Founded in 2010 by Jaime Schmidt, the brand emphasizes ingredient transparency and high-performance, natural formulations that exclude aluminum, artificial fragrances, and parabens. With a strong commitment to ethical and sustainable manufacturing, it has become a staple for health-conscious consumers seeking reliable odor protection. Today, the brand is widely recognized for its clean label, extensive ingredient disclosure, and status as a leader in the natural deodorant category.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "schmidtsnaturals"}}, "founded_year": "2010", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/33697949-06C0-4010-90CA-2A1A8431ED24-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "Schmidt's Naturals is a natural personal care brand known for its plant and mineral-based deodorants offering all-day odor protection without harmful chemicals.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "fr", "value": "Desodorants naturels primés à base de plantes et de minéraux, offrant une protection efficace sans aluminium, parfums artificiels ni parabènes."}, {"language": "de", "value": "Prämierte, pflanzenbasierte Natur-Deodorants, die zuverlässigen Schutz ohne Aluminiumsalze, künstliche Duftstoffe oder Parabene bieten."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Desodorantes naturales premiados a base de plantas y minerales, que ofrecen protección eficaz contra el olor sin utilizar aluminio, fragancias artificiales ni parabenos."}, {"language": "en", "value": "Plant-based, award-winning natural deodorants offering reliable odor protection without the use of aluminum, artificial fragrances, or parabens."}]}, "popularity": 0.8670644674611382, "disambiguation": "", "tags": [{"name": "Health & Beau